      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "Free access helps, but the bottleneck I've hit making science videos with these models isn't access — it's that the first draft is confidently wrong on the details I actually know. The training part matters more than the free part. Which fields do you think will actually change how they work, versus just doing the same work faster?"
      },
